WEBVTT

00:00:42.660 --> 00:00:43.890
I screwed up!

00:00:48.020 --> 00:00:51.980
That one actually had me worried there 
for a second, primitive creatures!

00:01:04.690 --> 00:01:08.170
Once I steal those genes, 
this planet is dust!

00:02:43.780 --> 00:02:48.170
"Defensive Battle at Cosmopolitan Academy
 (Second Part)"

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:49.480
Izuru...

00:02:59.280 --> 00:03:00.360
It missed?

00:03:00.870 --> 00:03:02.070
Izuru...

00:03:02.070 --> 00:03:04.570
Move it, primitive creature!

00:03:05.200 --> 00:03:07.200
I won't let you get your 
hands on our school!

00:03:26.840 --> 00:03:29.980
Gold 4's Mobile Assembly 
Extreme Range Cannon

00:03:29.980 --> 00:03:31.650
has begun recharging.

00:03:31.650 --> 00:03:33.310
It will be done in 15 minutes.

00:03:33.310 --> 00:03:36.530
Red 5's Harmonic Level is 
continuing to increase.

00:03:36.980 --> 00:03:40.110
But I'm not sure if he can 
sustain this for very long...

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:44.100
Blue 1, Rose 3, once you've 
eliminated your targets,

00:03:44.100 --> 00:03:45.240
go offer Red 5 support!

00:03:45.780 --> 00:03:46.510
Roger!

00:03:47.080 --> 00:03:48.990
Tamaki, what are you doing?!

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:52.350
Rose 3 isn't flying right!

00:03:52.350 --> 00:03:53.730
The unit musta gotten damaged here

00:03:53.730 --> 00:03:55.540
and there when we 
entered the atmosphere.

00:03:55.790 --> 00:03:57.430
Jeez, of all the times...!

00:04:05.510 --> 00:04:07.530
Hang tight, Izuru!

00:04:18.270 --> 00:04:20.300
Hurry! Hurry! Hurry it up!

00:04:20.300 --> 00:04:22.650
Please hurry and charge up!

00:04:22.950 --> 00:04:25.490
I'm going to send you some 
of Purple 2's energy.

00:04:25.490 --> 00:04:27.450
It should cut your charge time a bit.

00:04:27.450 --> 00:04:30.080
All pit ships, direct your 
energy to him as well.

00:04:30.080 --> 00:04:33.210
Relay the energy to Gold 
4 through Purple 2!

00:04:45.330 --> 00:04:47.180
Confirming receipt of 
the microwave energy.

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:49.930
Firing the energy to Gold 4!

00:04:54.460 --> 00:04:56.770
Wow, that's fast!

00:04:56.770 --> 00:04:59.860
Actually, isn't this dangerously fast?

00:05:04.530 --> 00:05:07.410
We won't make it in time if 
we wait for a full recharge.

00:05:07.410 --> 00:05:09.620
But without sufficient power,

00:05:09.620 --> 00:05:11.660
we can't shoot that enemy down!

00:05:17.000 --> 00:05:20.630
Your pathetic weapons can't harm me!

00:05:36.980 --> 00:05:37.650
Izuru!

00:05:43.780 --> 00:05:45.440
It's the end of the line.

00:05:57.490 --> 00:06:00.830
Asagi, Tamaki, now! Attack him!

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:03.090
You better dodge this, Izuru!

00:06:12.510 --> 00:06:15.240
No matter how many of you face 
me, the outcome will be the same!

00:06:18.270 --> 00:06:21.020
Please go straight!

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.370
This is bad.

00:06:23.370 --> 00:06:25.570
At this rate, I'm going 
to run out of energy...!

00:06:25.860 --> 00:06:27.240
We have to stop him, no matter what!

00:06:31.410 --> 00:06:33.530
Tamaki, ram into him from behind!

00:06:33.780 --> 00:06:35.410
Huh? Why?

00:06:35.700 --> 00:06:36.790
Just do it!

00:06:36.790 --> 00:06:38.330
Suruga, what's your energy at?

00:06:38.330 --> 00:06:40.870
Around 70%. It still isn't enough!

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:44.250
When Tamaki makes contact with 
Klein's unit, shoot Rose 3.

00:06:44.250 --> 00:06:45.980
At the same time, Izuru and Asagi,

00:06:45.980 --> 00:06:47.420
you are to help Tamaki escape!

00:06:47.840 --> 00:06:49.110
Shoot Rose 3...?

00:06:50.010 --> 00:06:51.090
Oh, I get it!

00:06:51.340 --> 00:06:52.010
Roger!

00:06:52.410 --> 00:06:54.180
Gold 4 is on the brink of overloading

00:06:54.180 --> 00:06:56.020
due to forcing it to recharge too fast.

00:06:56.020 --> 00:06:57.930
This is our last chance!

00:06:58.600 --> 00:07:00.390
There won't be any second 
chances if I miss.

00:07:00.890 --> 00:07:03.080
Calm down, Ataru Suruga!

00:07:03.080 --> 00:07:04.360
You can do it!

00:07:05.730 --> 00:07:07.300
You can do it...

00:07:07.300 --> 00:07:08.290
Calm down.

00:07:09.030 --> 00:07:10.080
Calm down...

00:07:13.410 --> 00:07:15.980
The sight's precision is improving!

00:07:15.980 --> 00:07:18.940
Could the pilot's heightened 
concentration have something to do with this?

00:07:18.940 --> 00:07:21.810
Gold 4's Harmonic Level 
is also increasing.

00:07:22.420 --> 00:07:24.430
This is his highest level thus far.

00:07:46.230 --> 00:07:47.230
Crap!

00:07:49.070 --> 00:07:50.150
You're finished!

00:07:50.150 --> 00:07:51.030
Izuru!

00:08:14.090 --> 00:08:15.430
These feeble attacks-

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:21.810
What are you plotting?!

00:08:22.060 --> 00:08:23.600
Tamaki, eject!

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.510
The enemy squad has been 
completely subdued!

00:09:33.510 --> 00:09:35.380
All five members of Team 
Rabbits are unharmed!

00:09:35.590 --> 00:09:37.640
They did it, Rin-Rin!

00:09:38.050 --> 00:09:40.300
Yeah, but it was close.

00:09:41.360 --> 00:09:43.770
Is that the extent of your power?!

00:09:43.770 --> 00:09:46.190
Show me what you're made of!

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:48.650
You still haven't given 
me a flippin' good fight!

00:09:49.270 --> 00:09:52.110
You need more freakin' fighting spirit!

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:55.030
Grab a pair of balls and come at me!

00:10:02.240 --> 00:10:04.370
I wanted to see Tamaki...

00:10:06.960 --> 00:10:08.500
Tamaki...

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.040
Which side's winning down there?

00:10:12.290 --> 00:10:16.220
I'm not sure, but the battle 
on Earth should be over soon.

00:10:16.760 --> 00:10:18.410
If Rabbits wins, it should

00:10:18.410 --> 00:10:20.840
influence our battle 
here on the frontlines.

00:10:25.470 --> 00:10:27.520
Look! The enemy is 
starting to pull back.

00:10:27.770 --> 00:10:31.560
Which means Izuru and the 
others won their battle, huh?

00:10:32.230 --> 00:10:35.190
All of you better be alive 
and hoppin', Bunnies!

00:10:35.400 --> 00:10:38.110
Klein's squad was annihilated?

00:10:38.280 --> 00:10:40.280
I'm afraid it would seem that way.

00:10:40.930 --> 00:10:44.350
We are approaching the limit to 
how long we can remain active.

00:10:44.790 --> 00:10:46.490
May we receive permission 
to return to base?

00:10:46.910 --> 00:10:50.290
Very well. Permission to 
return has been granted.

00:10:50.540 --> 00:10:52.530
I shall take a different route back.

00:10:53.040 --> 00:10:55.880
I will see you in person shortly.

00:10:59.390 --> 00:11:03.140
So the time to implement 
his plan has come...

00:11:25.620 --> 00:11:28.750
Fully dismantle each unit and 
give them thorough checks.

00:11:29.290 --> 00:11:31.170
Identify everything that 
needs to be replaced.

00:11:31.170 --> 00:11:32.180
For anything lacking a spare,

00:11:32.180 --> 00:11:34.130
contact Earth and have them 
send a replacement immediately!

00:11:34.630 --> 00:11:36.880
They might have to sortie again soon!

00:11:37.340 --> 00:11:39.050
Commence repair work at full power!

00:11:39.470 --> 00:11:42.260
It took an even worse 
beating than usual, huh?

00:11:42.260 --> 00:11:43.890
We're gonna be up all night!

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:47.590
Hey, we should be grateful that 
Izu-boing came back safe and sound.

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:50.100
It's proof that we've done a 
good job maintaining this puppy!

00:11:50.100 --> 00:11:53.500
Yeah! Now it's our turn to hop to work.

00:11:53.940 --> 00:11:55.610
You guys have it good...

00:11:55.610 --> 00:11:57.870
You can jump straight to work!

00:11:57.870 --> 00:12:01.740
Minus Rose 3's core, everything 
is still in pieces down on Earth.

00:12:01.740 --> 00:12:02.950
Yup, yup.

00:12:04.280 --> 00:12:06.130
The core was all that survived.

00:12:06.130 --> 00:12:07.660
Everything else has to 
be remade from scratch!

00:12:08.950 --> 00:12:10.730
I wish we could fly to 
Earth right this second

00:12:10.730 --> 00:12:13.310
and retrieve the battered 
and beaten Rose 3!

00:12:13.310 --> 00:12:14.580
Yup, yup.

00:12:15.830 --> 00:12:17.530
Our little lady is all right, isn't she?

00:12:17.530 --> 00:12:19.890
Yep! Her unit may have 
been terribly damaged,

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:21.930
but I've heard that our pilot 
walked away without a scratch.

00:12:21.850 --> 00:12:23.030
What a relief!

00:12:23.030 --> 00:12:25.810
If anything happened to 
her, it'd be our fault.

00:12:25.810 --> 00:12:28.180
We'll have to hold a party to 
celebrate her victory later.

00:12:28.180 --> 00:12:29.640
With a cake and tea!

00:12:29.640 --> 00:12:30.810
Agreed!

00:12:31.230 --> 00:12:33.560
I've heard that our 
Suruga was a big help.

00:12:33.850 --> 00:12:36.720
It proves that our theory was right!

00:12:36.720 --> 00:12:38.860
Ultimately, even sniping 
relies on physical prowess!

00:12:38.860 --> 00:12:41.650
His daily bodybuilding workouts 
with us are starting to pay off!

00:12:41.650 --> 00:12:43.570
Let's double our workout routine!

00:12:44.380 --> 00:12:48.320
Two sets of 100 push-ups and 
two sets of 100 sit-ups!

00:12:48.780 --> 00:12:49.790
Agreed!

00:12:50.290 --> 00:12:52.160
Everyone sure is hyped up...

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:55.170
It's normal for people to act 
this way after winning a battle.

00:12:55.170 --> 00:12:57.710
Izu-boing and the others 
did their best out there!

00:12:57.710 --> 00:13:00.590
Now it's our turn to 
step up and work hard.

00:13:00.590 --> 00:13:03.760
I bet they're sound 
asleep in bed by now...

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:10.350
The shock from the blast destroyed 
literally all of the school's windows.

00:13:10.350 --> 00:13:11.810
The building was also destroyed.

00:13:12.060 --> 00:13:14.770
Likewise, the inner facilities 
were substantially damaged!

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:17.940
Furthermore, you made a massive 
crater on school grounds!

00:13:17.940 --> 00:13:20.070
Naturally, the outer 
walls were also damaged!

00:13:20.650 --> 00:13:24.270
Blue 1 and Red 5's transport chains 
are damaged in countless locations!

00:13:24.270 --> 00:13:25.970
Purple 2 and Gold 4 were mostly

00:13:25.970 --> 00:13:28.610
destroyed by the shock created 
when the Mobile Assembly

00:13:28.610 --> 00:13:30.080
Extreme Range Cannon exploded.

00:13:30.080 --> 00:13:34.030
As for Rose 3, aside from the core, it 
was essentially blown to smithereens!

00:13:34.030 --> 00:13:36.960
It's going to take a long time before 
all of the spare parts come in

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:39.080
and your units are made 
operational again!

00:13:39.080 --> 00:13:43.320
Yeah... But, hey, we 
protected the academy!

00:13:43.320 --> 00:13:45.300
We should be happy it 
didn't turn out worse...

00:13:45.300 --> 00:13:47.090
There are limits to such things!

00:13:47.340 --> 00:13:49.930
What would you have done if 
you destroyed the school?!

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:53.850
But...

00:13:54.060 --> 00:13:56.890
Well, you did a good job out there.

00:13:56.890 --> 00:13:58.270
Job well done.

00:13:58.940 --> 00:13:59.920
Job well done.

00:14:01.020 --> 00:14:02.360
Job well done.

00:14:03.320 --> 00:14:04.280
Job well-

00:14:04.280 --> 00:14:05.120
Izuru?

00:14:09.140 --> 00:14:10.370
Don't fall asleep!

00:14:10.660 --> 00:14:14.460
Tamaki Irie, would you like 
to hang out with me tomorrow?

00:14:14.460 --> 00:14:18.540
Tamaki Irie, would you like 
to hang out with me tomorrow?

00:14:18.750 --> 00:14:22.130
Why do we have to hold 
his hand like this?

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:24.880
Since we're a team, 
we're as good as family.

00:14:24.880 --> 00:14:26.800
We live and die together, right?

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:29.220
Yo! Great work out there.

00:14:30.450 --> 00:14:32.320
Th-thank you. I'm honored.

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:34.650
Would you like to hang 
out with me tomorrow?!

00:14:34.850 --> 00:14:35.640
Pardon?

00:14:36.520 --> 00:14:38.600
Not what I meant! That was a mistake!

00:14:38.600 --> 00:14:39.810
That didn't happen! Scratch that!

00:14:39.810 --> 00:14:42.010
Dude, you need to calm down.

00:14:42.010 --> 00:14:45.220
I think you should pull back for 
now and regain your bearing.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:46.930
It's a tactical retreat.

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:50.700
So we'll chill out with 
you some other time, 'kay?

00:14:52.990 --> 00:14:55.240
Consequentially, the 
enemy forces retreated,

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:57.500
but the allied armies 
suffered immense losses.

00:14:58.040 --> 00:15:01.100
Earth's forces have been 
diminished to next to nothing.

00:15:01.880 --> 00:15:04.060
The masses seem to be 
greatly distraught as well.

00:15:04.420 --> 00:15:07.760
So their sense of danger 
is beginning to escalate.

00:15:07.760 --> 00:15:08.840
Correct.

00:15:08.840 --> 00:15:11.720
Until now, they probably considered 
this on the same level

00:15:11.720 --> 00:15:13.680
as military terrorists in 
the far reaches of space.

00:15:13.680 --> 00:15:16.470
But since this last attack was a 
direct assault on Earth itself...

00:15:16.770 --> 00:15:21.190
And nothing but the AHSMB seem to 
be effective against the Wulgaru?

00:15:21.400 --> 00:15:24.730
Right. If we don't start 
mass producing them...

00:15:24.940 --> 00:15:28.360
But will that alone be enough 
to drive the enemy away?

00:15:32.160 --> 00:15:34.950
I just received an encrypted 
message from Legatus Lumes

00:15:34.950 --> 00:15:38.940
that was hidden in a 
transmission from Earth.

00:15:38.940 --> 00:15:40.210
From Lumes?

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:44.590
When he came into contact with 
one of Earth's data devices,

00:15:44.590 --> 00:15:48.230
it would seem that he infiltrated 
and tampered with the system.

00:15:49.170 --> 00:15:52.010
At any rate, he gave the 
impression that he was already

00:15:52.010 --> 00:15:53.890
aware of your presence on Earth.

00:15:54.220 --> 00:15:57.010
So he has found out about us...

00:15:57.850 --> 00:15:59.390
But I came prepared to 
face the consequences...

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:01.320
According to the transmission,

00:16:01.320 --> 00:16:03.730
your brother is waiting 
to hear from you.

00:16:06.690 --> 00:16:08.900
How would you like me to respond?

00:16:13.570 --> 00:16:16.990
Not so much as a single unit 
from Klein's squad returned?

00:16:17.370 --> 00:16:20.200
Sir! Although they 
reaped what they sowed,

00:16:20.200 --> 00:16:22.330
it nonetheless pains my heart

00:16:22.330 --> 00:16:25.500
to lose an entire squad led 
by a Military Commander.

00:16:25.790 --> 00:16:28.230
Bluntly put, the position 
as Military Commander

00:16:28.230 --> 00:16:30.100
was too great for Klein.

00:16:30.100 --> 00:16:32.160
He was a disgrace to the Wulgaru race.

00:16:32.720 --> 00:16:35.510
Next time, we must choose someone 
a bit more worthy of the title.

00:16:35.510 --> 00:16:37.340
One who has not been fighting

00:16:37.340 --> 00:16:39.540
has no right to say such things, Lutiel.

00:16:39.540 --> 00:16:42.060
When you get down to it, 
was there a stock of

00:16:42.060 --> 00:16:44.350
DNA on the primitives' 
home world or not?

00:16:44.650 --> 00:16:47.940
Unfortunately, I am afraid we were 
unable to verify that information.

00:16:48.440 --> 00:16:52.150
Then why don't we hurry and 
send out the next squad?

00:16:52.150 --> 00:16:54.920
If you like, I'd be willing 
to dispatch the men.

00:16:55.360 --> 00:16:59.570
After this incident, I imagine 
Earth will be on heightened alert.

00:16:59.570 --> 00:17:02.500
I believe we should wait and 
watch for a while first.

00:17:02.500 --> 00:17:04.870
What a boring and cautious plan!

00:17:04.870 --> 00:17:06.540
It's just like you!

00:17:06.540 --> 00:17:08.630
There is one thing I wish to report.

00:17:09.250 --> 00:17:12.130
I took a look at Klein's battle 
records from his last skirmish.

00:17:12.590 --> 00:17:15.260
I've noticed that the humans 
frequently sacrifice themselves

00:17:15.260 --> 00:17:18.470
in order to rescue another individual.

00:17:18.470 --> 00:17:20.340
To meet those ends,

00:17:20.340 --> 00:17:23.480
sometimes they take unexpected 
measures to throw us into confusion.

00:17:23.980 --> 00:17:27.560
Doesn't that simply prove 
that they are lower animals?

00:17:27.560 --> 00:17:29.680
Rather than leisurely biding our time,

00:17:29.680 --> 00:17:31.570
we should finish them 
off in one fell swoop!

00:17:31.860 --> 00:17:35.180
In certain aspects, the Earthlings 
vary from other species

00:17:35.180 --> 00:17:36.980
we have encountered in the past.

00:17:37.410 --> 00:17:40.740
We cannot afford another mishap 
like with Legatus Klein.

00:17:52.460 --> 00:17:53.530
What are your thoughts

00:17:53.530 --> 00:17:56.110
in regard to Legatus Dolgana's 
observation earlier?

00:17:56.590 --> 00:17:59.720
About how the Earthlings 
defend one another?

00:17:59.720 --> 00:18:01.040
After all this time,

00:18:01.040 --> 00:18:04.350
it would seem that someone else 
has finally noticed that trait.

00:18:04.640 --> 00:18:07.810
Then you had already noticed 
this, Prince Jiart?

00:18:07.810 --> 00:18:08.940
Naturally.

00:18:09.440 --> 00:18:14.920
Usually, intelligent creatures have a 
tendency to develop overall equally.

00:18:15.400 --> 00:18:19.600
If one forms a weakness, its own 
kind will target that individual.

00:18:20.370 --> 00:18:24.620
But what if, one was guaranteed 
to not be attacked by the others?

00:18:25.200 --> 00:18:28.960
The various individuals 
could develop their talents,

00:18:29.460 --> 00:18:30.890
allowing them to compensate

00:18:30.890 --> 00:18:32.680
for their weaknesses while 
functioning in society.

00:18:33.710 --> 00:18:36.630
It would almost be as if 
they were one life form...

00:18:36.800 --> 00:18:39.220
But that is impossible.

00:18:39.220 --> 00:18:41.430
If the animals possess a certain 
degree of intelligence,

00:18:41.430 --> 00:18:42.720
it is only natural for the species

00:18:42.720 --> 00:18:45.100
to begin warring amongst 
themselves for personal gain.

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:46.810
That's right.

00:18:46.810 --> 00:18:48.500
Cooperation is only a possibility if

00:18:48.500 --> 00:18:51.170
both sides have something 
substantial to gain from it.

00:18:52.060 --> 00:18:54.780
As is the case with my clan and yours.

00:18:55.650 --> 00:19:00.280
My family has served your clan 
for generations, Prince Jiart.

00:19:01.240 --> 00:19:04.120
I am grateful that you 
allow me to serve you.

00:19:04.120 --> 00:19:07.710
The Earthlings are 
completely alien to us.

00:19:08.140 --> 00:19:10.960
But that is precisely 
what makes them amusing.

00:19:12.040 --> 00:19:14.380
I take it you were unable 
to make contact with Teoria?

00:19:14.380 --> 00:19:17.580
Correct. Instead I followed 
your instructions

00:19:17.580 --> 00:19:19.830
and sent a transmission to Daneel

00:19:19.830 --> 00:19:21.890
through the Earth's 
communications circuit.

00:19:22.280 --> 00:19:23.480
Unfortunately, I was unable to

00:19:23.480 --> 00:19:24.870
confirm whether he received the message.

00:19:24.870 --> 00:19:26.600
I take it no one noticed.

00:19:26.930 --> 00:19:28.980
Sir, not even King Galkie.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:30.030
Keep it that way.

00:19:30.520 --> 00:19:33.350
We shall give Teoria some 
time to see how she responds.

00:19:36.940 --> 00:19:37.690
Rada!

00:19:42.200 --> 00:19:43.980
It looks like he overheard us.

00:19:43.980 --> 00:19:45.330
What would you have me do?

00:19:48.540 --> 00:19:50.240
I learned something I shouldn't have!

00:19:50.800 --> 00:19:51.940
I'm dead!

00:19:54.290 --> 00:19:55.960
He's going to kill me!

00:19:56.500 --> 00:20:00.800
Legatus Rada, under orders by Pleguzes 
Jiart, you are under arrest!

00:20:01.180 --> 00:20:03.820
Under arrest?! What have I done?

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:06.760
Please take your question 
directly to Pleguzes.

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:09.560
"Treason," you say?

00:20:09.850 --> 00:20:10.810
Yes, your Majesty.

00:20:10.810 --> 00:20:14.980
Legatus Rada just came before 
Pleguzes Jiart and me

00:20:14.980 --> 00:20:18.460
and invited us to join him as 
conspirators in his rebellion.

00:20:19.150 --> 00:20:21.450
Naturally, we rejected his offer

00:20:21.450 --> 00:20:23.610
and are currently tracking Rada down.

00:20:23.860 --> 00:20:24.940
Rada did that...?

00:20:25.570 --> 00:20:27.890
Pleguzes Jiart requests that

00:20:27.890 --> 00:20:30.290
you leave the matter to his discretion.

00:20:35.500 --> 00:20:38.050
Very well. It is in his hands.

00:20:45.890 --> 00:20:47.010
How do you perceive this?

00:20:47.430 --> 00:20:50.930
The weak always lose. 
It's as simple as that.

00:20:51.080 --> 00:20:52.360
He outmaneuvered me!

00:20:53.520 --> 00:20:55.810
What should I do?! Where can I run?

00:21:00.330 --> 00:21:02.440
I must hurry and inform King Galkie!

00:21:02.440 --> 00:21:03.650
I must hurry!

00:21:03.650 --> 00:21:04.760
I must hurry or else...!

00:21:06.430 --> 00:21:08.740
Why aren't I getting through?!

00:21:17.250 --> 00:21:19.250
Don't come after me! Don't! Don't!

00:21:21.050 --> 00:21:23.300
That's it! I'll use that gate.

00:21:23.300 --> 00:21:24.880
If I can just make it through that...!

00:21:26.140 --> 00:21:27.590
Almost there!

00:21:57.500 --> 00:22:01.260
This is the Wulgaru way, Teoria...

00:23:40.940 --> 00:23:55.950
"Deep Recon"
